</ProtectedString></Properties></Item><Item class="ModuleScript" referent="RBX31FCD1B623994EA7876831F6FD69F5A0"><Properties><string name="Name">ModelLooks</string><ProtectedString name="Source">-- Material + colour for Blender meshes, by mesh name (the look name). Shared by ModelService and CarModelTool.
